format 1
adapter chat 1
npc: shrodi

node chat-shrodi-up-first
kind: unprompted
pose: cheer
trigger: lessons_completed:1
title: Your first lesson!

    You finished your first lesson!

    That is how every scientist starts: one question at a time.

    Want a quick tour of AtomIQ? It takes about a minute.

reply: Show me around -> chat-shrodi-tour-map
reply: What should I do next? -> chat-shrodi-next
reply: Thanks, Shrodi -> chat-shrodi-bye

node chat-shrodi-tour-map
kind: reply
pose: point

    Home is your map. Each circle is a lesson.

    [[pic:tour-map]]

    Finish one and the next circle opens. After a few lessons a new unit begins, with a new teacher.

reply: Next -> chat-shrodi-tour-quests
reply: Skip the rest -> chat-shrodi-tour-end

node chat-shrodi-tour-quests
kind: reply
pose: point

    Quests are small goals for the day and the week.

    [[pic:tour-quests]]

    Finish them to claim XP, then open the chest for diamonds.

reply: Next -> chat-shrodi-tour-games
reply: Skip the rest -> chat-shrodi-tour-end

node chat-shrodi-tour-games
kind: reply
pose: cheer

    Games is where you practise. In Atom Maze you run and jump, and answer questions to beat enemies.

    [[pic:tour-games]]

    Myth Buster is a quick round of fact or myth.

reply: Next -> chat-shrodi-tour-profile
reply: Skip the rest -> chat-shrodi-tour-end

node chat-shrodi-tour-profile
kind: reply
pose: explain

    Profile is your explorer passport: your level, your badges and your streak.

    [[pic:tour-profile]]

    After your second lesson the Shop opens: spend diamonds on hair, outfits and more.

reply: Next -> chat-shrodi-tour-phone
reply: Skip the rest -> chat-shrodi-tour-end

node chat-shrodi-tour-phone
kind: reply
pose: point

    And this is your phone. Teachers write to you in Chats, AtomDex is the encyclopedia, and new apps arrive as you learn.

    [[pic:tour-phone]]

    There is a lot to find. Take your time.

link: Open AtomDex => app atomdex
reply: Got it -> chat-shrodi-tour-end
reply: Tell me again -> chat-shrodi-tour-map

node chat-shrodi-tour-end
kind: sign_off
pose: proud

    That is the tour. Now it is your turn to explore.

    I am right here in your phone if you need me.
